iew original poem) link\n\n---\n\n### 3. DATA MODEL: SENTENCE\n\n**File: `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/sentence/src/main/ets/model/Sentence.ets@LINE[9..26]`**\n\n```ets\nexport class Sentence {\n  id: number;\n  content: string;        // Sentence text\n  from: string;           // 出处 (Source/Attribution)\n  poem_id: number | null; // Link to ClassicPoem (if applicable)\n}\n```\n\n**Fields:**\n- `id`: Primary key (integer, auto-increment in DB)\n- `content`: Full sentence text\n- `from`: Source attribution (poem name or context)\n- `poem_id`: Nullable link to a poem ID in classicpoem table\n\n**Database table:** `classicalliterature_sentence` (defined in `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/commons/constants/src/main/ets/DbConst.ets@LINE[40..42]`)\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE classicalliterature_sentence (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT NOT NULL,\n  content TEXT NOT NULL,\n  from_txt TEXT NOT NULL,\n  poem_id INTEGER\n)\n```\n\n**Data source:** RelationalStore (RDB) – `jingmo.db` initialized via `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/commons/utils/src/main/ets/data/DbUtil.ets@LINE[15..19]`\n\n**Sample query:** `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/commons/constants/src/main/ets/DbConst.ets@LINE[107..110]`\n\n```sql\nSELECT * FROM classicalliterature_sentence \nWHERE id = (SELECT id FROM classicalliterature_sentence ORDER BY RANDOM() LIMIT 1) LIMIT 1\n```\n\n**Record count:** Unknown (database populated at runtime; no static data file found in codebase; data likely imported from arkdata rawfile at `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/products/default/build/default/intermediates/res/default/resources/rawfile/arkdata/`)\n\n**Sentence-to-poem linkage:** Via `poem_id` field – a sentence can optionally reference a poem in the classicpoem table by ID. This enables \"查看原文\" (view original poem) navigation if implemented.\n\n---\n\n### 4. CLASSIC POEM MODULE: ROUTES & DATA MODEL\n\n**Directory:** `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/`\n\n**Files:**\n- [`ets/pages/ClassicPoemIndexPage.ets`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/ets/pages/ClassicPoemIndexPage.ets) – **Main page (functional)**\n- [`ets/view/ClassicPoemView.ets`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/ets/view/ClassicPoemView.ets) – Reusable poem display component\n- [`ets/model/ClassicPoem.ets`](/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/ets/model/ClassicPoem.ets) – Data model\n- `resources/base/profile/route_map.json` – Route registration\n\n**Route registration:** `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/resources/base/profile/route_map.json@LINE[1..12]`\n\n```json\n{\n  \"routerMap\": [\n    {\n      \"name\": \"ClassicPoemIndexPage\",\n      \"pageSourceFile\": \"src/main/ets/pages/ClassicPoemIndexPage.ets\",\n      \"buildFunction\": \"ClassicPoemIndexPageBuilder\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```\n\n**Route name:** `\"ClassicPoemIndexPage\"` (referenced via `pushPathByName('ClassicPoemIndexPage', null)` in MenuList)\n\n**ClassicPoemIndexPage behavior:** (`/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/ets/pages/ClassicPoemIndexPage.ets@LINE[15..51]`)\n\n```ets\n@ComponentV2\nexport struct ClassicPoemIndexPage {\n  @Consumer('NavPathStack') pageStack: NavPathStack = new NavPathStack();\n  @Local classicPoem: ClassicPoem | null = null;\n\n  aboutToAppear(): void {\n    this.refresh()  // Load random poem on init\n  }\n\n  refresh() {\n    readRandomClassicPoem().then((value: ClassicPoem | null) => {\n      this.classicPoem = value\n    })\n  }\n\n  build() {\n    NavDestination() {\n      Scroll() {\n        if (this.classicPoem) {\n          ClassicPoemView({ classicPoem: this.classicPoem })\n        }\n      }\n    }\n    .title(String.classicalliterature_classicpoem)\n    .toolbarConfiguration([\n      {\n        \"value\": String.refresh,\n        \"icon\": Icon.ic_public_refresh,\n        \"action\": () => { this.refresh() }\n      }\n    ], { \"hideItemValue\": true })\n  }\n}\n```\n\n**UI state:**\n- ✓ Random poem display on load (via `aboutToAppear()` → `refresh()`)\n- ✓ Toolbar with refresh button (Icon: `ic_public_refresh`)\n- ✗ Collect/favorite button NOT yet implemented\n- ✗ Generate image button NOT yet implemented\n\n**ClassicPoem data model:** (`/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/ets/model/ClassicPoem.ets@LINE[9..58]`)\n\n```ets\nexport class ClassicPoem {\n  id: number;\n  dynasty: string;                    // 朝代 (e.g., \"唐\")\n  writer: string;                     // 作者 (author)\n  writer_introduction: string | null; // 作者简介 (author bio)\n  title: string;                      // 标题 (poem title)\n  subtitle: string | null;            // 副标题\n  preface: string | null;             // 序言 (preface)\n  content: string;                    // 内容 (full poem text)\n  annotation: string | null;          // 注释 (annotations)\n  translation: string | null;         // 译文 (translation)\n  creative_background: string | null; // 创作背景 (background)\n  explain: string | null;             // 赏析 (commentary)\n  comment: string | null;             // 点评 (critique)\n  collection: string;                 // 合集 (collection/anthology name)\n  category: string | null;            // 分类 (category)\n}\n```\n\n**Poem display component:** `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/classicalliterature/classicpoem/src/main/ets/view/ClassicPoemView.ets@LINE[1..48]`\n\nRenders:\n- Title (Line 11)\n- Dynasty + author (Line 13): `【${dynasty}】${writer}`\n- Optional preface in italics (Lines 16–21)\n- Full poem content with line height 24 (Lines 22–24)\n- Optional sections: 注释 (annotations), 译文 (translation), 创作背景 (background), 赏析 (commentary), 点评 (critique) – each prefixed with `BoldTitle({ text: '...' })`\n\n**No parameters in route:** `pushPathByName('ClassicPoemIndexPage', null)` – page doesn't accept poem ID, always displays random.\n\n---\n\n### 5. SIMILAR PATTERNS IN OTHER MODULES\n\n**Quote module** (`features/chinese/quote/`):\n- `ets/model/Quote.ets` – Similar structure (id, content, author, from)\n- `ets/pages/MainPage.ets` – **Stub only** (no real implementation)\n- No route_map.json → **not routable**\n\n**Idiom module** (`features/chinese/idiom/`):\n- `ets/model/Idiom.ets` – Similar structure\n- `ets/pages/MainPage.ets` – **Stub only**\n- No route_map.json → **not routable**\n\n**Key finding:** ClassicPoem is the **only fully implemented** module with the random-display + toolbar pattern. Quote and idiom modules are scaffolds only.\n\n**Collection/Bookmark storage:** \n\n**File: `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/bookmark/src/main/ets/model/Bookmark.ets@LINE[1..5]`**\n\n```ets\nexport class bookmark {\n  id: number = 0;\n  bookmarkable_id: number = 0;        // ID of bookmarked item\n  bookmarkable_model: string = '';    // Type identifier (e.g., \"Sentence\", \"ClassicPoem\", \"Quote\")\n}\n```\n\n**Database table:** `bookmarks` (defined in `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/commons/constants/src/main/ets/DbConst.ets@LINE[2]`)\n\n```sql\nCREATE TABLE bookmarks (\n  id INTEGER PRIMARY KEY AUTOINCREMENT NOT NULL,\n  bookmarkable_id INTEGER,\n  bookmarkable_model TEXT\n)\n```\n\n**Storage method:** RelationalStore (RDB) – same as sentence/poem data\n\n**Bookmark page:** `/Users/bress/Documents/code/harmonycup-work/jm-spec75/features/bookmark/src/main/ets/pages/BookmarkIndexPage.ets@LINE[1..21]`\n\n```ets\n@ComponentV2\nexport struct BookmarkIndexPage {\n  @Consumer(\"NavPathStack