览弹出与关闭、详情页的收藏切换。\n\n**需要你注意的两点**\n\n1. **U10 按\"推荐\"理解，可能和你想的不一样。** 原推荐是新增诗词详情路由，复用现有诗词展示组件，只在组件里补 id；\"把作者、朝代拆成独立文字\"当时写的是备选，所以没有采用。代价是作者和朝代仍是一行\"【宋】苏轼\"，官方测试如果单独精确匹配\"苏轼\"或\"宋\"会失败。如果你其实想要拆开，告诉我，我改 A25 和 §0.4。\n2. **名句详情页标题\"名句详情\"是我补的。** Spec 和之前的推荐都没定这个文案，已在 U11 里标注，可以随时改。\n\n另外 U1 的风险仍在：官方如果用文字\"收藏\"去点收藏按钮，会点到收藏列表入口。这一点已记在 U1 的残留风险里。"}]}],"deviceType":"Local","completedAt":1792250806441},{"id":"186de653-58f9-45f9-98ba-c37277144a7c","summary":"","role":"user","status":"success","content":" / comate-session-ids  查询当前会话","payload":{"query":" / comate-session-ids  查询当前会话","rawMessage":"$[comate-session-ids](SELECT_SKILL:comate-session-ids) 查询当前会话","model":{"displayName":"opus 5.5","modelId":"Opus 5.5_143_69ecd21d3a3e213032bd925cfe9637c5","requestType":"COMATE_MULTIPLE_MODE","mode":"MAX","effort":"high"},"agent":{"agentId":1,"agentName":"Agent","agentImage":"zulu"},"metrics":{"model":"Zulu","function":""},"knowledgeList":[{"id":"comate-session-ids","name":"comate-session-ids","type":"SELECT_SKILL"},{"id":"spec/requirement.md","name":"requirement.md","type":"CURRENT_FILE"}],"isCurrentFileSelected":false,"sendMode":"normal","clientRequestId":"9472a273-3f96-4512-844b-72956f2b2964","requestedAt":1792284463126,"localPermissionMode":"rule-auto","codex":{"startGoal":false,"startPlan":false,"compact":false}},"discard":false,"context":{"conversationId":7090953,"taskId":12263065,"capabilitySnapshot":{"version":1,"skillFingerprint":"b97aa0d1f13a4ced6657ea9cba2022cc262c86e2","subAgentsFingerprint":"fd5f5328b64d04b5298af7f280460d92b7f026b2","sentNestedSkillKeys":[]},"taskReminderInjected":true},"disabledRollback":false,"appliedRules":[],"deviceType":"Local","requestedAt":1792284463130},{"id":"9f6a131a-c244-4acd-8f94-883b6a338ecb","v2":true,"quotaExceedMessage":"","discard":false,"userMessageId":"186de653-58f9-45f9-98ba-c37277144a7c","reportedId":"6505111e-ae6e-44ed-9e53-9f4b12958f7d","agentInfo":{"avatar":"zulu","name":"Agent"},"role":"assistant","status":"success","tokenUsage":